From e666911321d6905e5aced33c3ca8fd4a0e0630d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 22:00:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] Trial 3: transfer portal routes, rare D2 draft picks,
 level ratings

D2 players are now rarely drafted and never before round 4; standouts move
up through the transfer portal instead (FCS>FBS, D2>FBS, D2>FCS, with
real-world volumes). Recruiting services rank on upside while college
staffs offer on film. Level ratings compare high schoolers and college
players with the best in the nation at their position and age.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQgqp7rz4kKMexyFjLRnjv
